{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscheckboxpicker"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents18OUDSCheckboxPickerV","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCheckboxPicker"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"OUDSCheckboxPicker","symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSCheckboxPicker"}],"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false},{"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false},{"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false}]},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxPicker\/init(selections:checkboxes:placement:isReversed:isError:isReadOnly:hasDivider:itemsSpacing:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxPicker\/body"]},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxPicker\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxPicker\/View-Implementations"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxPicker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSCheckboxPicker","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Accessibility considerations","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and helper texts and a chekcbox trait.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However if defined in the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioPickerData","type":"reference"},{"text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In addition the root item of the picker has for accessiiblity identifier the displayed text.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Forbidden by design","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Forbidden-by-design"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"reference"},{"text":" in both an error situation and a read only state.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"reference"},{"text":" in both an error situation and a disabled state.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"reference"},{"text":" in both a read only and a disabled state.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in checkboxes using OUDSCheckboxPickerData.","    \/\/ This object has the same properties as the OUDSCheckboxItem,","    \/\/ and some of them are optional with default values set","    var someDataToPopulate: [OUDSCheckboxPickerData<String>] {","        [","        OUDSCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_1\",","                                       label: \"Virgin Holy Lava\",","                                       description: \"No alcohol, only tasty flavors\",","                                       image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")),","","        OUDSCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_2\",","                                       label: \"IPA beer\",","                                       description: \"From Brewdog company\",","                                       image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")),","","        OUDSCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_3\",","                                       label: \"Mineral water\",","                                       image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\"))","        ]","    }","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selections: [String] = [\"Choice_1\"] \/\/ or empty if nothing selected","","    \/\/ Here the picker is vertical by default","    OUDSCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections, checkboxes: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/ The picker can be vertical and have a root item with a label and a counter","    OUDSCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections,","                       placement: .verticalRooted(label, .textAndCount))","","    \/\/ The picker can apply some settings to all its radio buttons.","    \/\/ It can be also horizontal with a scroll indicator.","    \/\/ Here all the the checkboxes are in read only mode and use reversed layout.","    \/\/ Here the picker is horizontal and shows the scroll indicator","    OUDSCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections,","                       checkboxes: someDataToPopulate)","                       isReversed: true,","                       isReadOnly: true,","                       placement: .horizontal(true))"]},{"text":"Design documentation","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"There is no online specification as this component is not an official OUDS one","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Themes rendering","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Themes-rendering"},{"text":"Orange","level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_checkboxPicker_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"0.14.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Since","style":"note"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A picker allowing to expose several checkboxes and select some of them within the others.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each checkbox contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The picker will expose the choosen values using this “tag”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"reference"},{"text":" (divider, read only and error mode, layout and outlined)","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://OUDSComponents/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSCheckboxPicker/body":{"abstract":[],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"body"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View"}],"title":"body","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSCheckboxPicker\/body","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudscheckboxpicker\/body"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSRadioItem":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Radio button item is a UI element that allows to select a single option from a set of mutually exclusive choices."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Radio button item covers a wider range of contexts by allowing to toggle the visibility of additional text labels and icon assets."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudsradioitem","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":